# Machine learning models and data - KEEP ESSENTIAL MODEL FILES FOR DEPLOYMENT
# *.pkl - COMMENTED OUT - Keep trained RASA models
# *.joblib - COMMENTED OUT - Keep scikit-learn models
# *.h5 - COMMENTED OUT - Keep Keras/TensorFlow models
# *.hdf5 - COMMENTED OUT - Keep HDF5 model files
# Only exclude raw training data, keep processed models
data/raw/
# data/processed/ - COMMENTED OUT - Keep processed data for models
# checkpoints/ - COMMENTED OUT - Keep model checkpoints

